The static Space Grotesk faces the Windows window uses, unchanged from the Space Grotesk project at commit
03507d024a01282884232081fc6011c09ff4e849 (the same files as its release 2.0.0). WPF cannot set the weight of the variable
font in native/macos/fonts, so Windows ships these. Each file's SHA-256 is in SHA256SUMS; the build checks them first.
The project has no static SemiBold; the wordmark's weight 600 is drawn with Bold on Windows.
Space Grotesk is under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; its licence is native/macos/fonts/OFL-SpaceGrotesk.txt, shipped beside
these files. IBM Plex Mono comes from native/macos/fonts as it is.

SpaceGrotesk-Regular.ttf  https://github.com/floriankarsten/space-grotesk/blob/03507d024a01282884232081fc6011c09ff4e849/fonts/ttf/static/SpaceGrotesk-Regular.ttf
SpaceGrotesk-Medium.ttf   https://github.com/floriankarsten/space-grotesk/blob/03507d024a01282884232081fc6011c09ff4e849/fonts/ttf/static/SpaceGrotesk-Medium.ttf
SpaceGrotesk-Bold.ttf     https://github.com/floriankarsten/space-grotesk/blob/03507d024a01282884232081fc6011c09ff4e849/fonts/ttf/static/SpaceGrotesk-Bold.ttf
